sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Phone App
    participant GW as Gateway (GW)
    participant ED as End Device (ED)

    Note over App, ED: Phase 1: Basic Monitoring
    App->>GW: Read STATUS (0x2A1D)
    GW-->>App: RSSI, Zone, PHY, TX Power
    
    Note over App, ED: Phase 2: Inventory & State Sync
    App->>GW: Request Roster / State (CMD)
    GW-->>App: point_name, operational_state, sync_state
    
    Note over App, GW: Action Execution (e.g., Enter Maintenance)
    App->>GW: Action: Enter Maintenance
    GW->>GW: Update gw_point_state
    GW-->>App: ACK (sync_state = pending_sync)
    
    Note over GW, ED: Backend Sync (Conceptual)
    GW->>ED: Update Config / State
    ED-->>GW: Confirm
    GW->>GW: Update gw_ack (sync_state = synced)
    
    Note over App, GW: UI Update
    App->>GW: Poll/Notify Status
    GW-->>App: sync_state = synced (Green Badge)
